MainMenuAlert
{
	Id 66
	Header Feedback Survey
	Body We are looking for your feedback! Help us improve the game by spending a few minutes to take our Feedback Survey. This survey covers a broad range of topics—from crafting mechanics to playtime drops—and your input is essential as we continue to develop Unturned and these ideas!
	Color #f0f0f0
	Link https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfK-aacRNs-LWVgfAiQmrUAVwqpOZgmGwl49b1qUFDOf6GRCw/viewform
